Ngeneric:Invisible-Pin|pin@36||-108|31|||||SIM_spice_card(D5G1;)S[* CMOS 4-bit asynchronous up-counter,* Positive-edge-triggered DFFs,* Each D = Qbar; each Qbar clocks the next stage,".include \"C5_models.txt\"",.param VDD=5,* ==================================================,* CMOS inverter,* Ports: input output supply ground,* ==================================================,.subckt INV A Y VP VN,MP1 Y A VP VP PMOS L=0.6u W=3u,MN1 Y A VN VN NMOS L=0.6u W=3u,.ends INV,* ==================================================,* Two-input CMOS NAND gate,* Ports: inputA inputB output supply ground,* ==================================================,.subckt NAND2 A B Y VP VN,* Parallel PMOS,MP1 Y A VP VP PMOS L=0.6u W=3u,MP2 Y B VP VP PMOS L=0.6u W=3u,* Series NMOS,MN1 Y    A nmid VN NMOS L=0.6u W=3u,MN2 nmid B VN   VN NMOS L=0.6u W=3u,.ends NAND2,* ==================================================,* Active-HIGH D latch,* Ports: data enable Q Qbar supply ground,* ==================================================,.subckt DLATCH D E Q Qbar VP VN,XINV D dbar VP VN INV,* Input gating,XSET   D    E sbar VP VN NAND2,XRESET dbar E rbar VP VN NAND2,* Cross-coupled NAND latch,XQ    sbar Qbar Q    VP VN NAND2,XQBAR rbar Q    Qbar VP VN NAND2,.ends DLATCH,* ==================================================,* Positive-edge-triggered DFF,*,* Ports:,* D CLK Q Qbar QM QMbar supply ground,*,* QM and QMbar are master-latch nodes exposed only,* to allow explicit simulation initialization.,* ==================================================,.subckt DFF D CLK Q Qbar QM QMbar VP VN,* Clock inverters,XCLKINV1 CLK     clk_bar VP VN INV,XCLKINV2 clk_bar clk_buf VP VN INV,* Master latch,XMASTER D  clk_bar QM QMbar VP VN DLATCH,* Slave latch,XSLAVE  QM clk_buf Q  Qbar  VP VN DLATCH,.ends DFF,* ==================================================,* Supply,* ==================================================,vsupply vdd 0 DC {VDD},* ==================================================,* External clock: 100 ns period,*,* Starts HIGH to match the initialized latch states.,* Falls at 20 ns.,* First rising transition starts at 70 ns.,"* Following rising transitions: 170, 270, ... ns.",* ==================================================,vclock CLK 0 PULSE({VDD} 0 20n 2n 2n 48n 100n),* ==================================================,* Counter connections,*,* Instance ports:,* D    CLK   Q   Qbar  QM  QMbar  VDD GND,* ==================================================,* FF0: external clock; D0 = Q0bar,XFF0 Q0bar CLK   Q0 Q0bar M0 M0bar vdd 0 DFF,* FF1: clocked by Q0bar; D1 = Q1bar,XFF1 Q1bar Q0bar Q1 Q1bar M1 M1bar vdd 0 DFF,* FF2: clocked by Q1bar; D2 = Q2bar,XFF2 Q2bar Q1bar Q2 Q2bar M2 M2bar vdd 0 DFF,* FF3: clocked by Q2bar; D3 = Q3bar,XFF3 Q3bar Q2bar Q3 Q3bar M3 M3bar vdd 0 DFF,* ==================================================,* Output loads,* ==================================================,CQ0 Q0 0 250f,CQ1 Q1 0 250f,CQ2 Q2 0 250f,CQ3 Q3 0 250f,CQ0BAR Q0bar 0 250f,CQ1BAR Q1bar 0 250f,CQ2BAR Q2bar 0 250f,CQ3BAR Q3bar 0 250f,* ==================================================,* Simulation initialization: counter starts at 0000,*,* All clocks initially HIGH:,* masters hold 0; slaves pass that 0 to the outputs.,"* These are simulation conditions, not a reset circuit.",* ==================================================,.ic V(Q0)=0 V(Q0bar)={VDD},.ic V(Q1)=0 V(Q1bar)={VDD},.ic V(Q2)=0 V(Q2bar)={VDD},.ic V(Q3)=0 V(Q3bar)={VDD},.ic V(M0)=0 V(M0bar)={VDD},.ic V(M1)=0 V(M1bar)={VDD},.ic V(M2)=0 V(M2bar)={VDD},.ic V(M3)=0 V(M3bar)={VDD},* ==================================================,* Supply power and energy from 100 ns to 1700 ns,* Interval = 1600 ns,* ==================================================,.measure tran iavg AVG I(vsupply) FROM=100n TO=1700n,.measure tran pavg PARAM -VDD*iavg,.measure tran ipk MIN I(vsupply) FROM=100n TO=1700n,.measure tran pmax PARAM -VDD*ipk,.measure tran energy PARAM pavg*1600n,* ==================================================,* Simulation,* Long enough to show a complete counting cycle,* ==================================================,.options plotwinsize=0,.tran 0.05n 1700n 0 0.05n,.end]
