Ngeneric:Invisible-Pin|pin@39||-564|-153|||||SIM_spice_card(D5G1;)S[* CMOS active-HIGH D latch,* Four NAND gates and one inverter,".include \"C5_models.txt\"",.param VDD=5,* ==================================================,* CMOS inverter,* Ports: input output supply ground,* ==================================================,.subckt INV A Y VP VN,MP1 Y A VP VP PMOS L=0.6u W=3u,MN1 Y A VN VN NMOS L=0.6u W=3u,.ends INV,* ==================================================,* Two-input CMOS NAND gate,* Ports: inputA inputB output supply ground,* ==================================================,.subckt NAND2 A B Y VP VN,* Parallel PMOS,MP1 Y A VP VP PMOS L=0.6u W=3u,MP2 Y B VP VP PMOS L=0.6u W=3u,* Series NMOS,MN1 Y    A nmid VN NMOS L=0.6u W=3u,MN2 nmid B VN   VN NMOS L=0.6u W=3u,.ends NAND2,* ==================================================,* Supply,* ==================================================,vsupply vdd 0 DC {VDD},* ==================================================,* Input signals,* E starts HIGH so the latch initializes from D=0.,* D also changes while E is LOW to demonstrate hold.,* ==================================================,vdata D 0 PULSE(0 {VDD} 10n 2n 2n 18n 40n),venable E 0 PWL(,+ 0     {VDD},+ 55n   {VDD},+ 57n   0,+ 115n  0,+ 117n  {VDD},+ 175n  {VDD},+ 177n  0,+ 235n  0,+ 237n  {VDD},+ 300n  {VDD},+ ),* ==================================================,* Input gating,* sbar = NOT(D AND E),* rbar = NOT(dbar AND E),* ==================================================,XINV D dbar vdd 0 INV,XSET   D    E sbar vdd 0 NAND2,XRESET dbar E rbar vdd 0 NAND2,* ==================================================,* Cross-coupled NAND latch,* Q    = NOT(sbar AND Qbar),* Qbar = NOT(rbar AND Q),* ==================================================,XQ    sbar Qbar Q    vdd 0 NAND2,XQBAR rbar Q    Qbar vdd 0 NAND2,* Output loads,CQ    Q    0 250f,CQBAR Qbar 0 250f,* ==================================================,* Supply power and energy over 10 ns to 290 ns,* ==================================================,.measure tran iavg AVG I(vsupply) FROM=10n TO=290n,.measure tran pavg PARAM -VDD*iavg,.measure tran ipk MIN I(vsupply) FROM=10n TO=290n,.measure tran pmax PARAM -VDD*ipk,.measure tran energy PARAM pavg*280n,* ==================================================,* Simulation,* ==================================================,.options plotwinsize=0,.tran 0.05n 300n 0 0.05n,.end]
NMetal-1-Pin|pin@40||250|-130||||
NMetal-1-Pin|pin@41||340|-150||||
Ngeneric:Invisible-Pin|pin@42||-562|-227|||||SIM_spice_card(D5G1;)S[* Two-input CMOS NAND gate,".include \"C5_models.txt\"",.param VDD=5,.param TR=2n TF=2n,* Power supply,vdd vdd 0 DC {VDD},* Inputs: exercise all four logic combinations,* PW excludes rise/fall time,vin1 in1 0 PULSE(0 {VDD} 5n {TR} {TF} 18n 40n),vin2 in2 0 PULSE(0 {VDD} 5n {TR} {TF} 38n 80n),* MOSFET order: drain gate source bulk model,* Parallel PMOS pull-up network,MP1 out in1 vdd vdd PMOS L=0.6u W=3u,MP2 out in2 vdd vdd PMOS L=0.6u W=3u,* Series NMOS pull-down network,* nmid connects the two NMOS transistors,MN1 out  in1 nmid 0 NMOS L=0.6u W=3u,MN2 nmid in2 0    0 NMOS L=0.6u W=3u,* Output load,cload out 0 250f,* Average supply power over one complete input pattern,.measure tran iavg AVG I(vdd) FROM=85n TO=165n,.measure tran pavg PARAM -VDD*iavg,* Peak supply power over the same interval,.measure tran ipk MIN I(vdd) FROM=85n TO=165n,.measure tran pmax PARAM -VDD*ipk,* Supply energy per 80 ns input pattern,.measure tran energy PARAM pavg*80n,* Preserve waveform data for measurements,.options plotwinsize=0,* Simulate three complete input patterns,.tran 0.05n 245n 0 0.05n,.end]
