Ngeneric:Invisible-Pin|pin@36||-60|0|||||SIM_spice_card(D5G1;)S[* 4-bit ripple counter using clock-gated DFFs,".include \"C:\\Users\\adel\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\IC\\electric\\C5_models.txt\"",Vdd vdd 0 DC 5,* 10 MHz external clock,Vclk CLK 0 PULSE(5 0 20n 2n 2n 48n 100n),"* Counter runs first, pauses, then resumes",* EN goes low after count 8 and high again before the next valid edge,Ven EN 0 PWL(0 5 777n 5 779n 0 1177n 0 1179n 5 1700n 5),* Inverter,.subckt INV A Y VP VN,MP1 Y A VP VP PMOS L=0.6u W=3u,MN1 Y A VN VN NMOS L=0.6u W=3u,.ends INV,* Two-input NAND,.subckt NAND2 A B Y VP VN,MP1 Y A VP VP PMOS L=0.6u W=3u,MP2 Y B VP VP PMOS L=0.6u W=3u,MN1 Y A nmid VN NMOS L=0.6u W=3u,MN2 nmid B VN VN NMOS L=0.6u W=3u,.ends NAND2,* Active-HIGH D latch,.subckt DLATCH D E Q Qbar VP VN,XINV   D    Dbar  VP VN INV,XSET   D    E     Sbar  VP VN NAND2,XRESET Dbar E     Rbar  VP VN NAND2,XQ     Sbar Qbar  Q     VP VN NAND2,XQBAR  Rbar Q     Qbar  VP VN NAND2,.ends DLATCH,* Baseline DFF core,.subckt DFF D CLK Q Qbar VP VN,XCLKINV1 CLK     clk_bar VP VN INV,XCLKINV2 clk_bar clk_buf VP VN INV,XMASTER  D  clk_bar QM QMbar VP VN DLATCH,XSLAVE   QM clk_buf Q  Qbar  VP VN DLATCH,.ends DFF,* Safe clock gate,.subckt CLOCK_GATE CLK EN GCLK VP VN,XCLKINV  CLK     CLKbar  VP VN INV,XENLATCH EN      CLKbar  ENlat ENlatbar VP VN DLATCH,XNAND    CLK     ENlat   GCLKbar VP VN NAND2,XOUTINV  GCLKbar GCLK    VP VN INV,.ends CLOCK_GATE,* Optimized gated DFF,.subckt DFF_GATED D CLK EN Q Qbar VP VN,XGATE CLK EN GCLK VP VN CLOCK_GATE,XCORE D GCLK Q Qbar VP VN DFF,.ends DFF_GATED,* Ripple-counter connections,* D = Qbar makes every DFF toggle.,* Qbar clocks the next stage.,"* EN gates the first DFF, so EN=0 pauses the entire counter",XFF0 Q0bar CLK   EN  Q0 Q0bar vdd 0 DFF_GATED,* These stages use the optimized DFF too.,* Their enable is permanently high.,XFF1 Q1bar Q0bar vdd Q1 Q1bar vdd 0 DFF_GATED,XFF2 Q2bar Q1bar vdd Q2 Q2bar vdd 0 DFF_GATED,XFF3 Q3bar Q2bar vdd Q3 Q3bar vdd 0 DFF_GATED,* 250 fF output loads,Cq0 Q0 0 250f,Cq1 Q1 0 250f,Cq2 Q2 0 250f,Cq3 Q3 0 250f,* Start at binary 0000,.ic V(Q0)=0 V(Q0bar)=5,.ic V(Q1)=0 V(Q1bar)=5,.ic V(Q2)=0 V(Q2bar)=5,.ic V(Q3)=0 V(Q3bar)=5,.options plotwinsize=0,.tran 0 1700n 0 20p,.measure tran iavg AVG I(Vdd) FROM=100n TO=1700n,.measure tran pavg PARAM=-5*iavg,.measure tran energy PARAM=pavg*1600n,.end]
