Ngeneric:Invisible-Pin|pin@646||2570|-3080|||||SIM_spice_card(D5G1;)S[* 4-bit Register using clock-gated DFFs,".include \"C5_models.txt\"",Vdd vdd 0 DC 5,"* Clock rising edges: 25 ns, 125 ns, 225 ns, 325 ns",Vclk CLK 0 PULSE(0 5 25n 2n 2n 48n 100n),* Enable is ON at 25 ns and 225 ns only,Ven EN 0 PWL(0 5 75n 5 77n 0 175n 0 177n 5 275n 5 277n 0 400n 0),* Input word at each rising edge:,* 25 ns:  A B C D = 1 0 1 0  -> captured,* 125 ns: A B C D = 0 1 0 1  -> blocked by EN=0,* 225 ns: A B C D = 0 1 0 1  -> captured,* 325 ns: A B C D = 1 1 0 0  -> blocked by EN=0,Va A 0 PWL(0 0 10n 0 12n 5 90n 5 92n 0 290n 0 292n 5 400n 5),Vb B 0 PWL(0 0 90n 0 92n 5 400n 5),Vc C 0 PWL(0 5 90n 5 92n 0 400n 0),Vd D 0 PWL(0 0 90n 0 92n 5 290n 5 292n 0 400n 0),* Inverter,.subckt INV A Y VP VN,MP1 Y A VP VP PMOS L=0.6u W=3u,MN1 Y A VN VN NMOS L=0.6u W=3u,.ends INV,* Two-input NAND,.subckt NAND2 A B Y VP VN,MP1 Y A VP VP PMOS L=0.6u W=3u,MP2 Y B VP VP PMOS L=0.6u W=3u,MN1 Y A nmid VN NMOS L=0.6u W=3u,MN2 nmid B VN VN NMOS L=0.6u W=3u,.ends NAND2,* Active-HIGH D latch,.subckt DLATCH D E Q Qbar VP VN,XINV   D    Dbar  VP VN INV,XSET   D    E     Sbar  VP VN NAND2,XRESET Dbar E     Rbar  VP VN NAND2,XQ     Sbar Qbar  Q     VP VN NAND2,XQBAR  Rbar Q     Qbar  VP VN NAND2,.ends DLATCH,* Baseline positive-edge DFF core,.subckt DFF D CLK Q Qbar VP VN,XCLKINV1 CLK     clk_bar VP VN INV,XCLKINV2 clk_bar clk_buf VP VN INV,XMASTER  D  clk_bar QM QMbar VP VN DLATCH,XSLAVE   QM clk_buf Q  Qbar  VP VN DLATCH,.ends DFF,* Safe clock gate,.subckt CLOCK_GATE CLK EN GCLK VP VN,XCLKINV  CLK     CLKbar  VP VN INV,XENLATCH EN      CLKbar  ENlat ENlatbar VP VN DLATCH,XNAND    CLK     ENlat   GCLKbar VP VN NAND2,XOUTINV  GCLKbar GCLK    VP VN INV,.ends CLOCK_GATE,* Optimized clock-gated DFF,.subckt DFF_GATED D CLK EN Q Qbar VP VN,XGATE CLK EN GCLK VP VN CLOCK_GATE,XCORE D GCLK Q Qbar VP VN DFF,.ends DFF_GATED,* Four optimized DFFs with shared CLK and shared EN,XFFA A CLK EN QA QAbar vdd 0 DFF_GATED,XFFB B CLK EN QB QBbar vdd 0 DFF_GATED,XFFC C CLK EN QC QCbar vdd 0 DFF_GATED,XFFD D CLK EN QD QDbar vdd 0 DFF_GATED,* Same 250 fF output loads used in the baseline Register,Cqa QA 0 250f,Cqb QB 0 250f,Cqc QC 0 250f,Cqd QD 0 250f,.ic V(QA)=0 V(QB)=0 V(QC)=0 V(QD)=0,.options plotwinsize=0,.tran 0 400n 0 20p,.measure tran iavg AVG I(Vdd) FROM=10n TO=390n,.measure tran pavg PARAM=-5*iavg,.measure tran energy PARAM=pavg*380n,.end]
