Ngeneric:Invisible-Pin|pin@25||-62|11|||||SIM_spice_card(D5G1;)S[* CMOS Inverter - multi-cycle transient + power/energy,.include C5_models.txt,.param VDD=5,.param TR=2ns TF=2ns        ; input rise/fall,.param PW=20ns PER=40ns      ; high time and full period,vdd vdd 0 DC {VDD},"* repeating square wave: many switches, no hand-listed PWL points",vin in 0 PULSE(0 {VDD} 5ns {TR} {TF} {PW} {PER}),cload out 0 250fF,* ---- instantaneous supply power: p(t) = VDD * (-I(vdd)) ----,"* I(vdd) is negative when sourcing, so negate to get power delivered",.measure tran pinst PARAM='1'        ; placeholder so name exists (optional),"* measure on a settled cycle (2nd pulse), not the first",.measure tran tphl TRIG v(in)  val='0.5*VDD' rise=2,+                   TARG v(out) val='0.5*VDD' fall=2,.measure tran tplh TRIG v(in)  val='0.5*VDD' fall=2,+                   TARG v(out) val='0.5*VDD' rise=2,.measure tran tp param='(tphl+tplh)/2'      ; average propagation delay,* output edge rates,.measure tran trise TRIG v(out) val='0.1*VDD' rise=2 TARG v(out) val='0.9*VDD' rise=2,.measure tran tfall TRIG v(out) val='0.9*VDD' fall=2 TARG v(out) val='0.1*VDD' fall=2,* ================= POWER & ENERGY =================,* Average supply power over one settled period (40 ns: 45 ns -> 85 ns),.measure tran iavg  AVG  I(vdd) FROM=45ns TO=85ns,.measure tran pavg  PARAM='-VDD*iavg'        ; average power (W),* Peak instantaneous power over that period,.measure tran ipk   MIN  I(vdd) FROM=45ns TO=85ns   ; most-negative = biggest draw,.measure tran pmax  PARAM='-VDD*ipk'         ; peak power (W),* Energy per period = average power * period  (J),.measure tran energy PARAM='pavg*PER',* Energy per switching transition (2 edges per period -> /2),.measure tran e_per_switch PARAM='energy/2',.tran 0.05ns 200ns          ; ~5 cycles,.end]
